           'Selection uses predicted reference-path travel −5×contact upper bound −PSC upper bound −0.1×duration. Actual utility uses native event indicators. The depth0 comparator uses legal route distance/duration with no future human risk; memory CV shares the same learned event head. The hindsight oracle is diagnostic only. Reference-path travel is not geodesic progress to the goal, and this is not a navigation success metric.','',
