    lines=['# Complete online latency','', 'Reference device: CPU, Torch/BLAS/OpenMP one thread, affinity spanning36logical CPUs. Same host as collection; collector externally held. Sixty real development roots,660calls:600warm and60cold support-cache calls. Graphs range469–3,321cells; inferred slots0–13; source unique candidates3–19 are repeated to24evaluation rows and labeled. Horizon3s,16joint worlds,4refined candidates, at most5branches each. Initialization is separate. Final timers include evidence identity, graph updates, input construction, learned dynamics, probability filtering, common sampling, all event predictions, branch processing and successor construction. No GPU work exists to synchronize.','', '| Path/component |P50 ms|P95 ms|P99 ms|','|---|---:|---:|---:|']
    for mode in ('warm','cold_support_cache'):
        for k in ('observe','forecast','queries','graph_support','branches','complete'):
            v=lat['summary'][mode][k];lines.append(f"|{mode} / {k}|{v['p50']:.2f}|{v['p95']:.2f}|{v['p99']:.2f}|")
    init=np.percentile(lat['initialization_ms'],[50,95,99]);lines+=['',f"Initialization P50/P95/P99: {init[0]:.2f}/{init[1]:.2f}/{init[2]:.2f}ms. Query time includes support/branches, so component rows are not additive. P95 of a sum is not the sum of P95s. The strict65ms complete-call target and10ms observation target are missed; forecast15ms and warm refined-query40ms targets pass. Aggregate P95 is below100ms, but this does not establish integration readiness; P99 and dense strata exceed it.", '',
             'The profiling artifact `full_path_dense.prof` identifies association/candidate handling as the primary dense-root cost. Pre-optimization dense profiles spent most time in observation updates; Gaussian inversion, temporary arrays and moment merging dominated. Algebra-preserving scalar inversion and singleton compression reduced the earlier91ms warm P95 to66.7ms before evidence-identity/fingerprint instrumentation. Final warm P95 is72.6ms; final cold P95 is94.6ms. Cold geometry support checks contribute34.4ms P95. The ghost-track failure amplifies this cost. Removing people to win a latency benchmark would be scientifically invalid.','',
             'The352-call separately labeled synthetic stress includes24distinctqueries,8/16/32worlds,0/3/6/12/24people and529/3,025/12,100graph cells. Fifteen warmed calls per stratum exclude the initial cold call;16new-version calls each force support invalidation. At24people full-call P95 exceeds200ms. Thus high-density stability is not established. Increasing unrelated map size has little effect after local support caching; changing graph namespace revalidates routes. All100incremental graph updates, including overlay flattening, are recorded. These small strata have descriptive quantiles, not precise population-tail guarantees.','',
             '`budget_ms` records an overrun after completing the bounded work. It is not a hard deadline. The support cache is bounded256entries and graph overlays flatten at depth8. No inference operation depends on training set size, but offline event preparation currently materializes a corpus and must be chunked before1M training. CPU/GPU comparisons and concurrent-active-collector timing remain unmeasured.']
