      ('Anonymous association','One-to-one alternatives and persistent internal IDs are meaningful and tested, but they fragment and create ghost births in real data. Offline-aligned scores hide part of that error.'),
      ('Recursive successors','Survivor and terminal outputs can be passed back to the same API, with cursor/modes retained. Coarse observation recursion is not scientifically composable.'),
