           'The snapshot verifies37,171sourcequeries/5,178roots/835scenes. After protecting existing dev/confirmation, research uses29,573queries/4,149roots/677scenes; train/dev/holdout are scene-disjoint. The model trained on872independently supervised roots, not37k independent futures.','',
           '## Acceptance gates','', '| Gate |Conclusion|Evidence|','|---|---|---|',
           '|1 Legal information|Supported by audit/tests|No hidden geometry/future runtime reader; graph legality and extra-field invariance tested.|',
           '|2 Belief coherence|FAIL|Conserved but confidently wrong population; unsupported recovery remains unresolved.|',
           '|3 Recursive closure|Partial|Reusable states, persistent modes and absorption work; joint observation/population semantics incomplete.|',
           '|4 Observation consistency|FAIL|Within-call oracle identities pass; segmented observation law fails0.25vs0.0625.|',
